{"id":"word:hebrew:H1293","type":"word","title":"בְּרָכָה","subtitle":"H1293 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"benediction ; by implication prosperity","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בְּרָכָה (H1293) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 69 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בְּרָכָה (Bᵉrâkâh) means benediction ; by implication prosperity First listed occurrence: 1Sam 25 27."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בְּרָכָה","transliteration":"Bᵉrâkâh","pronunciation":"ber-aw-kaw'","strong":"H1293","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1293","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["בְּרָכָ֖ה","בִּרְכַּ֣ת","בְרָכָ֖ה","בְּרָכָֽה","בְּרָכָ֔ה"],"morphs":[["HNcfsa",22],["HTd/Ncfsa",10],["HNcfsc",7],["HNcfpc",6],["HR/Ncfsa",5],["HNcfpa",4],["HR/Ncfsc",3],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",3],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/R/Ncfsc/Sp2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"benediction ; by implication prosperity","usage":"blessing, liberal, pool, present.","full":"H1293. berakah I. בְּרָכָה noun feminine blessing (Arabic ; Ethiopic Aramaic בִּרְכָּא ; Late Hebrew as Hebrew) — ׳ב Gen 12:2 39t.; construct בִּרְכַּת 28:4 9 t.; suffix בִּרְכָתוֺ 49:28 7 t.; plural בְּרָכוֺת Psa 21:7 4 t.; construct בִּרְכֹת בִּרְכוֺת, Gen 49:25 5 t.; suffix בִּרְכוֺתֵיכֶם Mal 2:2 ; &#8212; 1 blessing: a. of parent Gen 27:12 , 41 ; 49:28 (JE), of Moses Deut 33:1 . b. of God Exod 32:29 (E) Lev 25:21 (P) Deut 11:26-27 , 29 ; 23:6 (= Neh 13:2 ) Deut 28:2 ; 28:8 ; 30:1 ; 30:19 ; Josh 8:34 (D) 2Sam 7:29 ; Psalm 3:9; Psa 21:4 ; 133:3 ; Isa 44:3 ; Ezek 34:26 ; 44:30 ; Joel 2:14 ; Mal 3:10 ; יהוה ברכת Gen 39:5 (J) Deut 12:15 ; 16:17 ; 33:23 ; Psa 129:8 ; Prov 10:22 ; י מאת ׳ברכה Psa 24:5 ; אברהם ברכת Gen 28:4 (P), the blessing given to Abraham. c. of the people , in recognition of good men Psa 109:17 ; Prov 10:6 ; 11:26 ; 24:25 ; 28:20 . d. of a poor man , in recognition of benefits Job 29:13 . 2 source of blessing: Abraham Gen 12:2 (J); Israel Isa 19:24 ; Ezek 34:26 ; Zech 8:13 ; seed of the righteous Psa 37:26 ; the king 21:7 ; memory of the righteous Prov 10:7 ; new wine Isa 65:8 . 3 blessing, prosperity: ישׁרים בברכת by the prosperity of the upright (the city is exalted) Prov 11:11 ; מורה יעטה ברכות גם yea, the early rain covereth with blessings Psa 84:7 compare Gen 49:25-26 , ברכותיכם את וארותי and I will curse your prosperity Mal 2:2 . 4 blessing, praise of God Neh 9:5 . 5 a gift, present Gen 33:11 (E) Josh 15:19 (J) Judg 1:15 ; 1Sam 25:27 ; 30:26 ; 2Kin 5:15 ; בְּרָכָה נֶפֶשׁ a liberal person Prov 11:25 (compare Syriac , Ethiopic ). 6 treaty of peace 2Kin 18:31 = Isa 36:16 .","rootNote":"from 1288 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 25 27","keyReferences":["1Sam 25 27","1Sam 30 26","2Kgs 5 15","2Kgs 18 31","2Sam 7 29","Deut 11 26","Deut 11 27","Deut 11 29"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":69,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 25 27","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּרָכָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 26","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּרָכָ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 5 15","book":"2Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְרָכָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 18 31","book":"2Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְרָכָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 7 29","book":"2Sam","chapter":7,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִ/בִּרְכָ֣תְ/ךָ֔","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 11 26","book":"Deut","chapter":11,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּרָכָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Deut 11 27","book":"Deut","chapter":11,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceW